{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-45","kind":"proposition","title":"把任意直线图形化为等面积平行四边形","englishTitle":"To construct, in a given rectilineal angle, a parallelogram equal to a given rectilineal figure.","book":1,"number":45,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.45","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.45/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":45,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","contentId":"euclid-1-45","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a052611bb2a77be635fe1a6560054fa518e2e4b60abfc1d969c08e7def8dd237","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-45.statement","euclid-1-45.construction.1","euclid-1-45.construction.2","euclid-1-45.proof.1","euclid-1-45.construction.3","euclid-1-45.proof.2","euclid-1-45.proof.3","euclid-1-45.proof.4","euclid-1-45.construction.4","euclid-1-45.proof.5","euclid-1-45.proof.6","euclid-1-45.proof.7","euclid-1-45.proof.8","euclid-1-45.conclusion","euclid-1-45.historical.1","euclid-1-45.historical.2","euclid-1-45.historical.3","euclid-1-45.historical.4","euclid-1-45.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-45.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f109e5f33bc5d48f3312bca99c07f5d01a3f0dec1592889a74d2d031ad972d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To construct, in a given rectilineal angle, a parallelogram equal to a given rectilineal figure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"要在给定的直角上构造一个平行四边形等于给定的直线数字。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有多边直线形求作一平行方形与之等而方形角有与所设角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于多边形线条，构造一个与其相等的平行四边形，且正方形的角等于设定的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"780a4d9c37bb2091b1835d00e75b72510ba666f844a680a8cacaff9d022e1bde","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD be the given rectilineal figure and E the given rectilineal angle; thus it is required to construct, in the given angle E, a parallelogram equal to the rectilineal figure ABCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCD是给定的直线数字,E是给定的直线角度;因此,需要在给定角度E上,构建相当于直线图ABCD的平行四边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23646b474e0bffa995dad66537cce3411cd01cf70344e2f16c0797ebeac598ac","citations":["euclid-1-42","euclid-1-44"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let DB be joined, and let the parallelogram FH be constructed equal to the triangle ABD, in the angle HKF which is equal to E; [[I. 42](/principles/euclid-1-42)] let the parallelogram GM equal to the triangle DBC be applied to the straight line GH, in the angle GHM which is equal to E. [[I. 44](/principles/euclid-1-44)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将DB连接起来,使平行四边形FH等于ABD三角形,在HKF角等于E;将平行四边形GM等于DBC三角形应用于GH直线,在GHM角等于E角。 [[I. 42](/principles/euclid-1-42)] [[I. 44](/principles/euclid-1-44)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fdcc7ce4d04f1d099f9bcb134667e2f1f1d95fef36f134da0d40bcf14993e885","citations":["euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the angle E is equal to each of the angles HKF, GHM, the angle HKF is also equal to the angle GHM. [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"礛由于角度E等于每个角度HKF,GHM, 角度HKF也等于角度GHM。 [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d4702d0cc437be69452bf1a09ba151ea3831b7062849c9ea2dfa298e48f454ac","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle KHG be added to each; therefore the angles FKH, KHG are equal to the angles KHG, GHM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将KHG角加到每个角;因此,FKH角和KHG角等于KHG角和GHM角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4d9737872593493f2b087b347fa42df742fe6f1e17ddc14fa23126cd4d31e437","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angles FKH, KHG are equal to two right angles; [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] therefore the angles KHG, GHM are also equal to two right angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但角度FKH,KHG等于2,直角,因此角度KHG,GHM也等于2,直角。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8720fb53517f0d20864bfcabd9c71fd7fd34e79a3b0976757bee1196dda096ea","citations":["euclid-1-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus, with a straight line GH, and at the point H on it, two straight lines KH, HM not lying on the same side make the adjacent angles equal to two right angles; therefore KH is in a straight line with HM. [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,有一条直线GH,在H点,两条直线KH,HM不在同一侧,使相邻角度等于2 直角;因此,KH直线与HM直线。 [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e2d5716d51b239a950f37ee31628f958a01d959993ff2238aa992138cf368caa","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the straight line HG falls upon the parallels KM, FG, the alternate angles MHG, HGF are equal to one another. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"HG直线相交 KM,FG,内错角,HGF, 等量彼此。（相关点与线段：MHG） [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2abece77fa700fb14ae32b1822d780dbba967baf9bc5f05cbf12a0ca3484c51","citations":["euclid-1-cn-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angle HGL be added to each; therefore the angles MHG, HGL are equal to the angles HGF, HGL. [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将HGL角加到每个角;因此,MHG角和HGL角等于HGF角,HGL角等于HGL角。 [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e0c4f237ec7a16f240e0806ae0a1201ee9950be7bb47e72bc2eec77de17a6ac8","citations":["euclid-1-29","euclid-1-cn-1","euclid-1-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angles MHG, HGL are equal to two right angles; [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] therefore the angles HGF, HGL are also equal to two right angles. [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)] Therefore FG is in a straight line with GL. [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但MHG,HGL的角度等于2,直角;因此,HGF,HGL的角度也等于2,直角。因此,FG的直线为GL。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)] [[I. 14](/principles/euclid-1-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e4069500e90a53271e331337385c77227032d78caf798509fb56cd031721dfb","citations":["euclid-1-34","euclid-1-cn-1","euclid-1-30","euclid-1-33"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since FK is equal and parallel to HG, [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] and HG to ML also, KF is also equal and parallel to ML; [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1);[I. 30](/principles/euclid-1-30)] and the straight lines KM, FL join them (at their extremities); therefore KM, FL are also equal and parallel. [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)] Therefore KFLM is a parallelogram."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FK是相等的,HG和ML也是平行的,KF也是相等的,ML和ML;] KM、FL直线(在极限线上)合二为一;KM、FL直线也相同,平行四边形直线也相同。（相关点与线段：KFLM）  [ [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] [C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1) [I. 30](/principles/euclid-1-30) [[I. 33](/principles/euclid-1-33)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"21f4330bbad386c2b62556b3a79dc37ca052c080c769d218582204b8c03df165","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the triangle ABD is equal to the parallelogram FH, and DBC to GM, the whole rectilineal figure ABCD is equal to the whole parallelogram KFLM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形ABD等于平行四边形 FH,DBC到GM, 整直线图ABCD等于整座平行四边形 KFLM。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1fe863ee738cf75c13bff7402630f11665b89bc17303e19c8f9ea6f35e301751","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the parallelogram KFLM has been constructed equal to the given rectilineal figure ABCD, in the angle FKM which is equal to the given angle E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,平行四边形 KFLM的构造等于ABCD直线图,角度FKM,等于指定角度E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e432e38b0000ec6ee99e2e8d764f4fbbb98aaaef6b326a175b8cd06205cc0c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所求作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ba966fd090465e5c07bd935b5dc1f7433f7e8aecd5c8749f91908c9d4d720ad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有多边直线形求作一平行方形与之等而方形角有与所设角等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"对于多边形线条，构造一个与其相等的平行四边形，且正方形的角等于设定的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"860497db5c5d3ef277240bd0195ae6a2337de89afcc3cbee849f995c86b546a7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"法曰：设甲乙丙五边形丁角求作平行方形与五边形等而有丁角先分五边形为甲乙丙三三角形次作戊己庚辛平行方形与甲等而有丁角〈本篇四二〉次于戊辛己庚两平行线引长之作庚辛壬癸平行方形与乙等而有丁角〈本篇四四〉末复引前线作壬癸子丑平行方形与丙等而有丁角〈本篇四四〉即此三形并为一平行方形与甲乙丙并形等而有丁角自五以上可至无穷俱仿此法"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"作图方法如下：令 甲乙丙 为五边形，丁 以平行四边形、五边形及 丁 角进行构造。首先，将五边形分割为 甲乙丙 的三个三角形，然后 戊己庚辛，平行四边形等于 甲，及 丁 角。〈本篇四二〉 画两条与 戊辛己庚 平行的线，画 庚辛壬癸 平行四边形，平行四边形等于 乙，且 丁 具有 〈本篇四四〉 角。绘制前线为 壬癸子丑，平行四边形等于 丙，并具有 丁 角。〈本篇四四〉 将这三种形状组合为一个，平行四边形和 甲乙丙 是平行四边形，且 丁 等于 丁。五个以上的角可达到无穷大，均遵循此方法。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23b4f100a85229ccdd86642f813be0201597e57b748a9a9c1da879f25f36fc1b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：戊己庚与辛庚癸两角等而每加一己庚辛角即辛庚癸己庚辛两角定与己庚辛戊己庚两角等夫己庚辛戊己庚是两平行线内角与两直角等也〈本篇廿九〉则己庚辛辛庚癸亦与两直角等而己庚庚癸为一直线也〈本篇十四〉又戊辛庚与戊己庚两对角等而辛壬癸与辛庚癸两对角亦等则戊己庚辛庚辛壬癸皆平行方形也〈本篇卅四〉壬癸子丑依此推显〈本篇三十〉即与戊己癸壬并为一平行方形矣"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：戊己庚 和 辛庚癸 是两个相等的角，每增加一个 己庚辛 角表示 辛庚癸己庚辛 和 辛庚癸己庚辛 等于 己庚辛戊己庚，且 己庚辛戊己庚 是两条平行线，其两个内角等于两个直角。〈本篇廿九〉 于是 己庚辛辛庚癸 也等于两个直角，己庚庚癸 是一条直线。〈本篇十四〉 并且 戊辛庚 与 戊己庚 拥有相等的对角，辛壬癸 和 辛庚癸 也是平行四边形 〈本篇卅四〉壬癸子丑 所以 〈本篇三十〉 和 戊己癸壬 是平行四边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e286b910bb9158718336282c1c8bd37967639a38c1e1541964896e96650a49a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"===増题两直线形不等求相减之较几何===法曰：甲与乙两直线形甲大于乙以乙减甲求较几何先任作丁丙己戊平行方形与甲等次于丙丁线上依丁角作丁丙辛庚平行方形与乙等〈本题〉即得辛庚戊己为相减之较矣何者丁丙己戊之大于丁丙辛庚较馀一辛庚戊己也则甲大于乙亦辛庚戊己也"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"=== 附加问题：两条线不相等，求减法的比较几何 === 作图方法如下：甲 和 乙 两条线 甲 大于 乙。使用 乙 减去 甲 来找到比较几何。首先，画 丁丙己戊 平行四边形，甲 相等。在 丙丁 线上，画 丁丙辛庚 平行四边形，并在 丁 的角画 乙。〈本题〉 于是得出 辛庚戊己 作为减法比。为什么 丁丙己戊 大于 丁丙辛庚 且余数为 辛庚戊己？然后 甲 大于 乙 且也大于 辛庚戊己。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-45.source","contentId":"euclid-1-45","revisionId":"euclid-1-45@raw-a052611bb2a77be6","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"45a37c4334a13901e609698db0d232998f69628aacb8c25a4ae262c0784a57a6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provena